    ### 🧩 4. Linkleri `?PageNumber=` olarak düzelt

    #### 🔧 Pagination kısmı:

    ```cshtml
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
        @if (Model.PageNumber > 1)
        {
            <a href="?PageNumber=@(Model.PageNumber - 1)&Search=@Model.Search" class="btn btn-link">Previous</a>
        }

        @for (int i = 1; i <= Model.TotalPages; i++)
        {
            <a href="?PageNumber=@i&Search=@Model.Search" class="btn btn-link @((Model.PageNumber == i) ? "active" : "")">@i</a>
        }

        @if (Model.PageNumber < Model.TotalPages)
        {
            <a href="?PageNumber=@(Model.PageNumber + 1)&Search=@Model.Search" class="btn btn-link">Next</a>
        }
    </div>
    Artık:
    - `/Index?PageNumber=1` → ilk sayfa
    - `/Index?PageNumber=3` → 3. sayfa
    - Search çalışırsa → `/Index?PageNumber=2&Search=Math`

